{"base_path":"/","components":null,"consumes":"[\"application/json;charset=UTF-8\"]","definitions":{"AssociateIssueDetail":{"description":"关联工作项详情","properties":{"issue_id":{"description":"工作项ID","example":1234,"format":"int32","type":"integer"},"project":{"$ref":"#/definitions/SimpleProject"},"status":{"$ref":"#/definitions/StatusVo"},"subject":{"description":"工作项标题","example":"工作项标题样例","type":"string"},"user":{"$ref":"#/definitions/SimpleUser"}}},"AssociateIssueRequest":{"description":"关联工作项请求对象","properties":{"associatedIssueIdList":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n待关联工作项ID列表。本次操作需要新增关联关系的目标工作项ID集合。\n**约束限制**:\n每个元素为字符串形式的工作项ID(服务端自动转换为整数);不能包含issueId自身;单工作项关联总数受系统上限约束。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","example":["71058792"],"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"attachProjectUUId":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n目标项目UUID。标识待关联工作项所属的项目;跨项目关联时必填,同项目关联时可省略。\n**约束限制**:\n32位UUID字符串;若与projectUUId不同则视为跨项目关联。\n**取值范围**:\n32个字符,由小写字母和数字组成。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","example":"45fba8eff9f3492585ce846767028f73","type":"string"},"issueId":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n源工作项ID。即需要建立关联关系的工作项唯一ID。\n**约束限制**:\n工作项必须存在且未被归档。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","example":71058791,"format":"int32","type":"integer"},"projectUUId":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n源项目UUID。标识执行关联操作的源工作项所属项目。\n**约束限制**:\n32位UUID字符串,必填字段。\n**取值范围**:\n32个字符,由小写字母和数字组成。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","example":"45fba8eff9f3492585ce846767028f73","type":"string"},"unassociatedIssueIdList":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n待取消关联工作项ID列表。本次操作需要解除关联关系的目标工作项ID集合;可在同一次请求中混合使用以支持关联关系调整。\n**约束限制**:\n每个元素为字符串形式的工作项ID;仅处理已存在的关联关系。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","example":[],"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["projectUUId","issueId"],"type":"object"},"AssociateIssueResponse":{"description":"关联工作项响应对象","properties":{"result":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n本次新增的关联关系记录列表,每个元素对应一条关联关系。","items":{"$ref":"#/definitions/AssociateIssueDetail"},"type":"array"},"status":{"description":"**参数解释**:\n接口整体响应状态。\n**取值范围**:\n- success:关联工作项成功。\n- error:关联工作项失败,详见错误码说明。","example":"success","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"ErrorRsp":{"description":"失败时返回的错误对象","properties":{"error_code":{"description":"错误码。","maxLength":36,"minLength":8,"type":"string"},"error_msg":{"description":"错误描述,对error_code的补充解释。","maxLength":512,"minLength":2,"type":"string"}},"required":["error_code","error_msg"],"type":"object"},"SimpleProject":{"properties":{"project_id":{"description":"项目id","example":"58d9050550c847c89885c1797a718b0c","type":"string"},"project_name":{"description":"项目名称","example":"创建项目12","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"SimpleUser":{"properties":{"nick_name":{"description":"用户昵称","example":"大熊","type":"string"},"user_id":{"description":"用户uuid","example":"a360371833bf4c558f796fd707b44daf","type":"string"},"user_name":{"description":"账号名","example":"demo_user_name_xiongzhitest001","type":"string"},"user_num_id":{"description":"用户数字id","example":4091,"type":"integer"}}},"StatusVo":{"description":"状态","properties":{"id":{"description":"状态id","example":"1","type":"string"},"name":{"description":"状态id对应的值","example":"未开始","type":"string"}}}},"description":null,"group_id":"986b06428ba54ab7a1b0a2cac7203d2a","host":"projectman-ext.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com","id":"29e0e46448e34db6b4b9786e939694e2","info_version":"v4","method":"post","name":"AssociateScrumIssue","parameters":{},"paths":{"/v2/issues/associate-issue":{"post":{"description":"将一个工作项与一个或多个目标工作项建立关联关系,同时支持在同一次请求中取消已有关联。\n关联关系建立后会同步生成 journal 动态记录,并受单工作项关联数量上限约束。","operationId":"AssociateScrumIssue","parameters":[{"description":"**参数解释**:\n用户访问凭证。通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n长度为10~32768个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。","in":"header","name":"X-Auth-Token","required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"**参数解释**:\n关联工作项的请求体,包含源项目UUID、目标项目UUID、源工作项ID、待关联列表、待取消关联列表。\n**约束限制**:\n单工作项关联数受系统上限约束;不允许操作已归档工作项。","in":"body","name":"body","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/definitions/AssociateIssueRequest"}}],"responses":{"200":{"des